Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.07,0:00:01.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,In terms of go to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:02.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,market, Well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:03.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,OK, it's so actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,interesting that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,open core
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,because we tried open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,core and it really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,didn't work for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:08.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it didn't work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:12.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,because we would sell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:13.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,features in theory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:15.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,like unlocking the stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,that isn't the open
