Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then really what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:20.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,customers think they're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:22.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,buying is like 24/7
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,on-call SRE support to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,make sure that like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,know PostHog works in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,every weird iteration of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:29.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,like you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:30.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,infrastructure that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:31.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,people could come up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,with at one point we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:33.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,were literally debugging
