Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:36.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,through like pictures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:38.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,taken of a screen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:39.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,Because their policies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:41.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,were so strict that they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:43.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,weren't allowed to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:44.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,screenshots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:44.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,So it was really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:45.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,painful. that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.91,0:00:47.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think, was very hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:47.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,for us to make work
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.85,0:00:48.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,and actually when we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:49.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,just pivoted to only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.81,0:00:50.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,focusing on cloud for
